==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Rudie is an anthropomorphic brown reindeer with a rounded physique, unguligrade legs and a large, red nose. He has lighter patches of brown on his face, insides of his ears and on his torso. His hooves, spots and neck fur are dark brown, and he has red and white candy cane-like antlers on the top of his head. During [[Blackouts]], his nose glows red.

|-|Vintage=
Vintage Rudie gains a monochromatic color palette, as well as two triangle cuts in his pupils, one in each on the left side. During [[Blackouts]], instead of red, his nose glows white.

|-|Blue Bell=
Blue Bell Rudie is a much lighter shade of brown, with white head spots and neck fur instead of dark brown. He gains a pair of jingle bell-covered bracelets, with blue bases. His nose is also blue. His hooves become a slightly warmer brown, and his antlers become this same shade and stripe-less. During [[Blackouts]], his nose glows blue.

|-|Holly Jolly=
Holly Jolly Rudie is a much redder, brighter color than before, with a piece of holly on his left ear. His neck fluff is replaced by a red-and-green striped scarf, which shares colors with his antlers. His head spots, hooves, and new-found freckles are all a darker, very warm brown.

|-|Snow-Time=
Snow-Time Rudie is a light grey and white reindeer, with purple pants and head spots. Instead of neck fluff, he now wears a light blue, purple, and white shawl. This shawl has a large, white-and-blue bow on the front. He also now dons a cape, which fades from purple to light blue, with white fluff at the end. His hooves and antlers now fade from a very light cyan to purple, with his hooves and cape carrying a moving pattern. He has light blue marks under his eyes. During [[Blackouts]], his nose glows a very light blue.

|-|Golden Antlers=
Golden Antlers Rudie is a warm brown, with three white freckles on each cheek. His ear tips, hooves, neck fur, and antlers are all golden. He now wears a golden crown on his right antler, which is adorned with red ovular gems. He also has a large, red bow on the back of his neck fur.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Rudie is a cheerful and friendly [[Toon]] who has a passion for the holidays. He has a very jolly and happy personality, and is always in a festive spirit. True to how he was in the [[Dandy's World (Show)|Show]], he's an extreme enthusiast of Christmas to the point of thinking it is every day, and getting upset when anyone denies it; but when it comes to him talking to [[Bobette]], he tells her that his favorite holiday is still every day "in [his] heart", technically somewhat confirming he's only pretending to be a Christmas enthusiast for entertainment's sake. Towards children, he always asks them if they're on the nice list, making him have a Santa Claus-esque role.

