==Trivia==
*Rudie is one of the first [[Holiday Toons]] added in the game, along with {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}, {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, and {{CI|Ginger|name=true}}.
**He is also the first male Holiday Toon to be released, and also the only male Christmas Toon.
*Rudie, {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}} and {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}} are all anthropomorphic [[Toons]] with non-plantigrade legs (Rudie is unguligrade, while Eclipse and Cocoa are digitigrade). Rudie is the first Toon with this trait.
**Coincidentally enough, they are all [[Holiday Toons]], each one being from a different [[Event]].
**He is the only {{Type|Common}} and male Toon to do so.
*It might be implied that the reason Rudie thinks every day is Christmas is because of how the [[Christmas]] [[Holiday Toons]] naturally isolate themselves when it's not winter, leading him to be constantly excited or yearning for said [[Event]].
**However, according to [[Bobette]]'s [[Gossip]], Rudie has had this habit in the [[show]], so Rudie's constant delusion could also be because he never left his old personality/role in the show: a Christmas enthusiast.
*Rudie, {{CI|Flutter|name=true}}, and {{CI|Flyte|name=true}} share the same [[Ability]] sound.
*Rudie was the first [[Holiday Toon]] to be teased.
*Rudie shares the same [[Stat]] spread with the starters and other {{Type|Common}} [[Event Toons]] {{Small|(3 {{Star}} in all stats)}}.
**Rudie is the only one out of these five [[Toons]] to have an Active [[Ability]].
*Rudie has the third shortest ''Active'' [[Ability]] cooldown (if not counting {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}), being beat by {{CI|Brusha|name=true}} and {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}}.
**When choosing the {{CDI|Rehearsal/Practice|name=true}} Cards while using {{TI|Ghost Snakes In A Can|name=true}} and {{TI|Sweet Charm|name=true}}, and walking in {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}}'s {{AI|Waxwell|name=true}} trail, you will get an even shorter Ability cooldown of about 3.1 seconds.
**Unlike Brusha, he's always had his current Active Ability cooldown, originally having the shortest one.
*Rudie's appearance and name are heavily based off the famous Christmas character, {{Wp|Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer}}.
*Despite Rudie being stated to be a male, male reindeer shed their antlers during the winter months, while the females retain their antlers.
*One of his renders for the [[Ornament]] store implies that he knows how to juggle.<ref>[[File:Rudie Purchase 2.png|200px]]</ref>
*Rudie's BlueBell Rudie<ref>[[File:BlueBell Rudie Rudie.png|200px]]</ref> [[Skin]] used to be named Blue Bell, making him one of two [[Toons]] to have their Skins renamed in-game, the other being {{CI|Razzle & Dazzle|name=true}} whose SeaFoam Skin was formerly labeled as Seafoam.
**This also makes Rudie the only [[Toon]] with their name in a [[Skin]].
*Rudie is the third [[Toon]] in the game to be an actual living thing, rather than an object, being a reindeer.
*Rudie is the only [[Christmas Toon]] to not receive any major [[Ability]] changes or reworks in the [[2025 Christmas Event]].
*If you enter the "Lore Room" on the [[Seasonal Room]] as Rudie, he will say "{{Text|Woah...}}", making him the third [[Toon]], along with all the other [[Christmas Toons]], with dialogue outside of being in the [[Elevator]], using an [[Ability]] or finishing a [[Machine]], with the first being {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, and the second being {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}.
**Rudie, along with the other 2 non-{{Type|Main}} Christmas Toons, are the first Toons to have these dialogues in a "Lore Room" that is not theirs, being [[Bobette]]'s instead.
***They are also the first non-Main Character Toons to have dialogues in a "Lore Room".
*Sometimes, there will be a bug where Rudie has an apparent Passive [[Ability]].
*Rudie and [[Ginger]] are the first [[Toons]] to have exclusive Golden Skin [[Quests]].
*Rudie's {{AI|Rudie|name=true}} [[Ability]] cannot be used to walk past {{CI|Twisted Rodger|name=true}} when he is activated.
*Rudie is one of the three first [[Toons]] to have official voices which appeared in [[The Perfect Christmas]] song with Rudie's voice actor being AXIE, the other two Toons with voices are [[Bobette]] and [[Ginger]].
*However, these aren't confirmed to be canon.
*Rudie, [[Ginger]], and [[Coal]] are the sixth [[Toons]] to appear in 2 separate thumbnails, appearing in the [[Changelog|v0.14]] and v0.14.10 thumbnails, with the first being {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}, the second being [[Shrimpo]], the third being {{CI|Toodles|name=true}}, the fourth being {{CI|Rodger|name=true}} and {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, and the fifth being [[Bobette]].
*Some time during the [[2026 Easter Event]], Rudie's [[Ability]] description was changed to be more ambiguous about its effects, removing the cooldown, potency, and its duration from the description.

